# Public URL of the deployed site, without a trailing slash. Read at build time.
#
# It sets:
#   - the base path the site is served from (taken from the URL's path), and
#   - the canonical URL, og:url, og:image and sitemap.xml.
#
# You normally do NOT set this yourself: the GitHub Pages workflow
# (.github/workflows/deploy.yml) passes the real Pages URL from GitHub.
# Set it locally only to reproduce the production build, e.g.:
#
# VITE_SITE_URL=https://shabdasinha1.github.io/shabda-sinha-portfolio
VITE_SITE_URL=
